Hi Ravi,
One of the outputs from fieldObject() is the X and Y coordinate of each object.

With this information, you can include text on your plots using the R function text() as described in this link: http://www.sthda.com/english/wiki/add-text-to-a-plot-in-r-software

Hope this can help you.

All the best,
Filipe

